{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL1NvdXRoX0luZGlhbi9IaW5kaS1EdWJiZWQvMjAwMC0tMjAxNS9Tb2xvJTIwJTI4MjAxMSUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Solo","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/jDsHU9GGNcsV6roRmNBt9lGto7Q.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oNFnVPTJ7CIVJnJp7iiCswVWX65.jpg","description":"Gautham Nara Rohith is an orphan who always wishes to get married to a girl from a joint family to experience the love of relationships and elders. He falls in love with Vaishnavi Nisha Aggarwal who belongs to a joint family. He tries to woo her and finally she agrees and fall in love with him too. Vaishnavi shares a very good relationship with everyone at home especially her dad Naidu Prakash Raj. One day he gets to know about his daughter and Gautham's relationship. He dislikes it as he always wanted to get his daughter married to a guy who belongs to a good family. He sets an alliance with someone else. What happens next forms the rest.","releaseInfo":"2011","genres":["Romance","Drama","South Indian"],"imdbRating":"5.4","runtime":"150 min","cast":["Nara Rohith","Nisha Agarwal","Prakash Raj","Sayaji Shinde","Jayasudha","Ali","Srinivasa Reddy","Rao Ramesh"],"director":["Parasuram Petla"],"released":"2011-11-25T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Nara Rohith","character":"Gowtham","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nfgWrE7d3IJwCDhwzg895djIQbB.jpg"},{"name":"Nisha Agarwal","character":"Vaishnavi","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zxsCJu6Hn86RD7ZoMBMuKFFYxCe.jpg"},{"name":"Prakash Raj","character":"Raghupathi Naidu","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dJvFZOXmZdkYCOUcKTXQAhBcAoH.jpg"},{"name":"Sayaji Shinde","character":"Vishwanath","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/r4VBYop4XktGuSZ0wozRqJbEzMH.jpg"},{"name":"Jayasudha","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xOP3pYlrqyBw5x9CDEMkYXPzpNu.jpg"},{"name":"Ali","character":"James Cameron","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xAlsMcBNmkBS2KT6jqMUjGirv